<div class="blockquote">
<p><strong>Unexplained Location UE-655588</strong><br />
<strong>Description:</strong> A small communal, Christian church marked in city records as &quot;the West Tennesse Peoples Church of Churchism&quot;, shown to be entirely constructed of organic matter. The only other feature of note surrounding UE-655588 is that the object was formerly Pastor Henry Ecclesia, who slowly transformed into the church between 1970 and 1971.<br />
<strong>Date of Containment:</strong> 1971-03-12<br />
<strong>Location:</strong> Outside Clarksville, Tennesse.<br />
<strong>Security Protocol:</strong> The church is to be patrolled by two guards, under the cover story of Asbestos Cleanup operations. All individuals who enter the church are to be removed. Any individuals who discover the objects anomalous properties are to be provided with Class-A amnestics.<br />
<strong>Note:</strong> A small plaque was found engraved on the southwestern flank of the structure, transcribed below:</p>
<blockquote>
<p>TO THE GLORY OF GOD 1971:</p>
<p>THIS CHURCH WAS MADE OF AND BY PASTOR HENRY ECCLESIA. HIS SACRIFICE TO BECOME ONE WITH THE LORD AND HIS FOLLOWERS WILL NEVER BE FORGOTTEN. HIS BLOOD, SWEAT, TEARS, ORGANS, SKIN, AND MUSCLES WERE USED TO BUILD A HOME FOR OUR LORD AND HIS SUN. [sic]</p>
<p><em>”Those who wish to be a church can be under God, for that is his way.”</em> - Jesus Christ (Assumed).</p>
</blockquote>
<p><strong>Unexplained Location UE-96843</strong><br />
<strong>Description:</strong> A small Victorian Era house originally owned by 'Sir Oswald Francis', a tea-trader from the United Kingdom. When the attic door is opened, it will lead to an extradimensional location roughly resembling a massive tea plantation. In the centre of the plantation is a large factory complex. Every individual who enters the pocket dimension will simultaneously appear in both the attic entrance (which leads to a small shack) and the factory. They will also feel an impossible compulsion to harvest tea from the plantation and put the leaves on a pully within the structure, and then to place a weight on the other pully. The individual who moves out of the factory will be unable to exit the dimension, whereas the individuals who enter via the attic entrance will be able to exit. Several notable individuals are within the structure including, but not limited to, George Washington, Winston Churchill, Queen Elizabeth II, Sir Oswald Francis, Kristina Francis, every member of the beetles, and 83 duplicates of an unidentified worker.<br />
<strong>Date of Containment:</strong> Since Foundation Inception.<br />
Location: Ganges Delta, Bangladesh.<br />
<strong>Security Protocol:</strong> Two guards stationed around the structure. Produced tea checked for anomalies and sold as a part of Sir Conrod Products (an SCP foundation front company.)</p>
<blockquote>
<p><strong>Unexplained Location UE-39221</strong><br />
<strong>Description:</strong> Roughly 204 billion exoplanets 189 billion light-years from Earth, with several anomalous effects. The planets exist within the radius of each other where gravitational action would result in their destruction, and move in erratic and impossible patterns. The planets, when viewed through a satellite, resemble 21 tangled double-helix structures forming into large structures. Despite these structures large mass, no gravitational effects occur on nearby planets. The double helix structure of this planetary system is sometimes threaded through large masses of planets, which somehow causes a single helix structure to move from this mass, flip, and then thread itself together with another double helix structure.<br />
When the atmospheric composition and sizes of these planets are accounted for, the planets can be assigned to several elements from the periodic table. Using this model, the planetary structure has been found to be an exact match to the genome of a human male, with 16% Irish heritage, 53% Indian heritage, 30.2% English descent and 0.2% from other locations. The individual is known to have blue eyes, red hair, and pale white skin. So far no exact genetic match for this has been found.<br />
<br />
<strong>Date of Containment:</strong> 2014-05-12, After discovery by foundation FTL probe.<br />
<strong>Location:</strong> Galaxy supercluster XY-539222.<br />
<strong>Security Protocol:</strong> It is unlikely that UE-39221 will ever be discovered, due to extreme distances from the earth, and as such, no security protocol is needed.</p>
</blockquote>
</div>
<p>All of these logs were pruned for length &#8212; entries to this list should be of relatively short length, and not extensively detailed.</p>
