<p><strong>Seeking Greenlights:</strong> Yes</p>
<p><strong>Page Type:</strong> SCP Article</p>
<p><strong>Genre (Optional):</strong> Joke / Horror</p>
<p><strong>Page Layout (Optional):</strong> Image, containment procedures, description, experiment logs</p>
<p><strong>Elevator Pitch:</strong> 2 anomalous entities designated SCP-XXXX-A and B. XXXX-A is a house, in which objects placed in it vanish after a couple hours. XXXX-B is a middle-aged woman living inside the house, who can summon any object upon request.</p>
<p><strong>Central Narrative:</strong> Researchers looking into possible uses for SCP(s) who can manifest objects at will. (This is planned, but not yet integrated.)</p>
<p><strong>Hook/Attention-Grabber:</strong> Description of SCP told from perspective of a burglar. XXXX-B summons human leg bones covered in old, decayed flesh.</p>
<p><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> I have a sandbox whipped up for this idea already. Very, very rough, but if you want to take a look at it, I can link it as requested.</p>

